活動内容:
Hello! We are the Fantastic Tennis Club, an officially recognized club at Waseda University. We hold 10 practice sessions per week, both in the mornings and afternoons from Monday to Friday, so you can play tennis around your own schedule, whether it’s for school or a part-time job!! We’re also known for our welcoming, family-like atmosphere where experienced players and beginners train together in a 1:1 ratio—everyone is welcome!/
///
//Since we hold level-based practices, everyone from beginners to experienced players can train at their own pace!! We focus not only on experienced players but also on coaching beginners, and we’ve even won the Beginners’ Cup!/
///
//And it’s not just about tennis—we host events year-round, including summer camps, ski trips, and Christmas parties, so you’re sure to have a great time!! Whether you’re just curious about tennis or want to play seriously, why not join Fantasia and enjoy the best college life with the best friends?

